      "content": "1200mg every 4 hours?? that sounds like a crazy amount of ibuprofen. i read somewhere that taking that much can cause stomach bleeding or kidney issues. is there maybe a different way to manage the pain so i don't have to go to the hospital right this second? like is there a specific supplement or something else i can take instead of all those pills?",
